\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. He that is down needs fear no fall,
\par He that is low' no pride;
\par He that is humble ever shall
\par Have god to be his guide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I am content with what I have,
\par Little be it or much;
\par And, Lord, Contentment still I crave,
\par Because Thou savest such.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Fullness to such a burden is
\par That go on pilgrimage;
\par Here little, and hereafter bliss,
\par Is best from age to age.
\par 
\par  \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

